    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A BACnet/IP Access Control Controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents the access family (Access Door, Credential Data Input, Access Point, Access Zone, Access Credential, Access Rights), an Event Log, a Schedule/Calendar pair, a File object for backup/restore, a Notification Class, three read-only sensor objects and the required Network Port. Blocked Example: it makes no grant/deny decision and generates no access event (CAS BACnet Stack #2150, #2044). It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ACC profile."
    },
